      "options": {
        "content": "## Manual Metrics Check\nUse these shell commands once the trading service is up to confirm trades are clearing the manifest gate after throttling:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s localhost:9010/metrics | rg 'trading_(trade_attempts_total|realized_pnl_sum)'\n```\n\n```bash\nredis-cli -u $TRADING_AUDIT_REDIS_URL XREAD COUNT 5 STREAMS trading:audit 0\n```\n\nThe Prom query surfaces attempt and P&L counters, and the Redis read samples the audit stream for confirmation.",
